                        </div>
                        <div class="text-center md:text-left">
                            <div class="w-14 h-14 border border-accent/30 bg-accent/5 flex items-center justify-center mb-5 mx-auto md:mx-0 text-accent">
                                <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor" class="w-7 h-7">
                                    <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9.53 16.122a3 3 0 00-5.78 1.128 2.25 2.25 0 01-2.4 2.245 4.5 4.5 0 008.4-2.245c0-.399-.078-.78-.22-1.128zm0 0a15.998 15.998 0 003.388-1.62m-5.043-.025a15.994 15.994 0 011.622-3.395m3.42 3.42a15.995 15.995 0 004.764-4.648l3.876-5.814a1.905 1.905 0 00-1.907-2.975L12.88 3.27m-2.928.728A21.248 21.248 0 007.5 11.25" />
                                </svg>
                            </div>
                            <h3 class="font-syne text-lg font-bold mb-2">Design unique, pas de template</h3>
                            <p class="font-inter text-sm text-gray-500 leading-relaxed">Votre site ne ressemblera à aucun autre. Un design créé sur-mesure pour votre activité.</p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="text-center md:text-left">
                            <div class="w-14 h-14 border border-accent/30 bg-accent/5 flex items-center justify-center mb-5 mx-auto md:mx-0 text-accent">
                                <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor" class="w-7 h-7">
                                    <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 12.75L11.25 15 15 9.75m-3-7.036A11.959 11.959 0 013.598 6 11.99 11.99 0 003 9.749c0 5.592 3.824 10.29 9 11.623 5.176-1.332 9-6.03 9-11.622 0-1.31-.21-2.571-.598-3.751h-.152c-3.196 0-6.1-1.248-8.25-3.285z" />
                                </svg>
                            </div>
                            <h3 class="font-syne text-lg font-bold mb-2">Devis gratuit, sans engagement</h3>
                            <p class="font-inter text-sm text-gray-500 leading-relaxed">On discute de votre projet, je vous fais une proposition claire. Vous décidez, sans pression.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
